    "detailed_description": "GREAT NEWS: &quot;Spirit of Adventure&quot; from the legendary German game development studio Attic Entertainment is finally available on Steam.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;Spirit of Adventure&quot; is a 2.5D dungeon crawl RPG game in which you'll take charge of a group of 6 heroes that you can freely choose and determine. Each of these characters is equipped with their own abilities that can be useful in your missions.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs you make your way through the world of &quot;Spirit of Adventure&quot;, you'll meet many people with whom you can interact. But who can you trust? Who is on your side? Start a battle against the forces of evil and against a religion and secure the future of your world.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Classical 2.5D dungeon crawler RPG game<br />\r\n- Create your own powerful team of heroes and choose between 4 different classes<br />\r\n- Equip your hero squad with countless equipment items and prepare them for their adventure",
